Maintainer: Jeff Gardner <mailmasker-api01@forge.name>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), perl (>= 5.40)
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Homepage: https://github.com/permittivity2/homelab

Package: homelab-postfix-exporter
Architecture: all
Depends: prometheus-postfix-exporter
Recommends: homelab-agent, homelab-node-exporter, homelab-postfix
Description: Postfix (mail-flow) metrics exporter wiring for homelab-*
 Wraps the Ubuntu-archive prometheus-postfix-exporter on the mail-sending
 hosts. The upstream unit already reads the postfix journal
 (--systemd.enable); this advertises the exporter (kind: metrics-exporter,
 :9154) so homelab-prometheus discovers + scrapes mail-flow metrics
 (messages processed/delivered/bounced/deferred, SMTP delays, queue sizes).
 Install on each homelab-postfix host.
